<title>USA: CCC seeks 6,360 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Tunisia.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 6,360 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Tunisia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking up to 6,360 tonnes of U.S. no. 2 or better hard red winter wheat for donation to Tunisia.</p>
<p>The CCC, a part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the shipment period was slated for August 10-August 31.</p>
<p>Offers were due on July 22, it said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
